## 19. ANIMATION & INTERACTION

Add refined, performance-friendly motion throughout the website.

### Scroll animations

- Fade-in on section entry
- Slight upward movement of 20–30px
- Staggered animation for card grids
- Smooth reveal of headings
- Image fade transitions

### Hover effects

- Images scale subtly between 1.00 and 1.04
- CTA arrows shift slightly right
- Buttons smoothly change background and text color
- Navigation underline animates
- Portfolio images receive subtle zoom
- Service cards slightly elevate only when appropriate

### Scroll behavior

- Smooth scrolling
- Sticky header
- Subtle active navigation state
- No aggressive parallax
- Avoid scroll-jacking

### Motion rules

- Use 300–700ms transitions
- Use ease-in-out or cubic-bezier timing
- Avoid bouncing animation
- Avoid continuously moving objects
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`

The animations must improve the premium experience without distracting from the interiors.

