## 20. RESPONSIVE DESIGN

The website must be fully responsive and look professionally designed on every screen size.

### Desktop — 1440px and above

- Wide editorial layouts
- Large hero photography
- Maximum content width approximately 1380px
- Generous margins
- Two-column and asymmetric layouts
- Four-column service/principle strip where appropriate

### Laptop — 1024px to 1439px

- Adjust hero proportions
- Reduce headline size
- Maintain image quality
- Reduce section padding
- Keep navigation clean

### Tablet — 768px to 1023px

- Two-column grids where possible
- Simplified hero layout
- Reduced typography
- Comfortable spacing
- Services remain visually balanced
- Footer reorganizes

### Mobile — 320px to 767px

- One-column layouts
- Compact navigation with accessible hamburger menu
- Hero headline approximately 44–60px depending on width
- Hero image placed beneath or alongside the text without crowding
- Full-width CTA buttons where appropriate
- Cards stacked vertically
